<!-- Playbook accordion -->
<div class="panel">
  <h2>{{ t('How to read this board', '如何看懂本看板') }}
    <span class="lag-tag">{{ t('field guide', '实战指南') }}</span>
  </h2>

  <div class="playbook-section open">
    <div class="playbook-hd">
      <span>{{ t('1 · The one job of this board', '1 · 本看板的唯一任务') }}</span>
      <span class="caret">▸</span>
    </div>
    <div class="playbook-body">
      <p class="l-en">This board watches a fixed list of institutional leaders — the Mag 7, AI infrastructure, AI software and semiconductors, semicap equipment, reshoring, defense and power-grid names. It looks for one specific thing: a leader that sold off, absorbed the selling, and is now being <em>bought back on real volume</em>. For every name it gives you a plain call — buy now, almost ready, in favour, take profits, watch, or stand aside — and the reason behind it. It is not a stock screener for cheap stocks; it is a timing board for continuation entries in names that already have sponsorship.</p>
      <p class="l-zh">本看板跟踪一份固定的机构领涨股名单——Mag 7、AI基础设施、AI软件与半导体、半导体设备、回流制造、国防与电网标的。它只找一件事：某只领涨股经历下跌、消化卖压、如今正被<em>放量重新买入</em>。对每只标的给出一个通俗结论——现在买入、即将就绪、走势占优、获利了结、观望或暂时观望——并附上理由。这不是找廉价股的筛选器，而是为已有机构参与的标的把握延续入场时机的择时看板。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="playbook-section">
    <div class="playbook-hd">
      <span>{{ t('2 · What each call means', '2 · 每个结论的含义') }}</span>
      <span class="caret">▸</span>
    </div>
    <div class="playbook-body">
      <ul class="l-en">
        <li><b>🟢 Buy now</b> — sold off recently, reclaimed above the day’s average price on durable (not one-spike) volume, and it is a clean leader. The continuation setup is live; stop goes below the washout base.</li>
        <li><b>🔵 Almost ready</b> — the base is built but price hasn’t reclaimed yet. Waiting for a push back above the average price on volume.</li>
        <li><b>🏃 In favour</b> — already trending and holding above the average price, but with no fresh washout. Ride an existing position; not a fresh entry.</li>
        <li><b>🟠 Take profits</b> — stretched well above the average price, or jammed into a dealer ceiling / expiry pin. Expect a pullback; don’t chase.</li>
        <li><b>👀 Watch — don’t chase</b> — moving, but without a washout base, or a name with a history of faking breakouts. Wait for structure.</li>
        <li><b>⚪ Stand aside</b> — quiet tape, no setup right now.</li>
      </ul>
      <ul class="l-zh">
        <li><b>🟢 现在买入</b> —— 近期下跌后，在持续（非单次）放量中收复当日均价，且为干净的领涨股。延续布局已成立；止损设在洗盘底部下方。</li>
        <li><b>🔵 即将就绪</b> —— 底部已成，但价格尚未收复。等待放量重回均价上方。</li>
        <li><b>🏃 走势占优</b> —— 已在趋势中并守住均价上方，但无新的洗盘。适合持有已有仓位，非新入场点。</li>
        <li><b>🟠 获利了结</b> —— 大幅高于均价，或顶到做市商天花板/到期钉价。预期回落，勿追。</li>
        <li><b>👀 观望——勿追</b> —— 有异动，但无洗盘底部，或该标的有假突破前科。等待结构。</li>
        <li><b>⚪ 暂时观望</b> —— 盘口平静，当前无布局。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="playbook-section">
    <div class="playbook-hd">
      <span>{{ t('3 · The options tape (approximate direction)', '3 · 期权资金带（方向为近似）') }}</span>
      <span class="caret">▸</span>
    </div>
    <div class="playbook-body">
      <p class="l-en">The options column shows tape activity and how persistently it leans call-heavy or put-heavy. <em>The direction is approximate</em> — it is signed by a tape rule, not by matching each trade to the bid/offer, so read it as a lean, never a confirmation (that is what the <span class="soft-tag">~soft</span> mark means). Unusual-size flags (big blocks, fresh positions, size-vs-open-interest) are exact counts. It is a supporting input, not a trigger on its own.</p>
      <p class="l-zh">期权栏展示资金带的活跃度，以及其偏看涨或看跌的持续程度。<em>方向为近似</em>——它由盘口规则定向，而非将每笔交易与买卖报价匹配，故仅作倾向、绝非确认（这正是 <span class="soft-tag">~软性</span> 标记的含义）。异常规模标记（大单、新建仓、规模对比未平仓量）为精确计数。它是辅助输入，不单独作为触发。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="playbook-section">
    <div class="playbook-hd">
      <span>{{ t('4 · The dealer map (levels &amp; stops, not direction)', '4 · 做市商地图（价位与止损，非方向）') }}</span>
      <span class="caret">▸</span>
    </div>
    <div class="playbook-body">
      <p class="l-en">Built from daily options chains, the dealer map shows the nearby levels market-makers tend to defend — a <em>ceiling</em> above and a <em>floor</em> below — the day’s expected move, and whether price is being pinned near a big strike into expiry. Use it for timing and stop placement: a hard ceiling just overhead argues against chasing; a strong floor below is a logical stop reference. It is never a direction call, and for a single stock the long/short-gamma label is a near-constant trait of the product, not a live signal — so it is shown as context only.</p>
      <p class="l-zh">做市商地图由每日期权链构建，展示做市商倾向防守的邻近价位——上方<em>天花板</em>与下方<em>地板</em>——当日预期波动幅度，以及价格是否在到期临近时被钉在某大行权价附近。用于择时与设置止损：头顶紧邻硬天花板则不宜追高；下方有强地板可作止损参考。它绝非方向判断；对单只股票而言，多头/空头gamma标签是产品近乎恒定的属性，而非实时信号——故仅作背景展示。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="xs muted" style="margin-top:10px">
    {{ t('Options-tape direction is approximate (~soft — a tape rule, not bid/offer matching). Every call is a deterministic rule with no score and no black box. Reference levels and the dealer map are context for timing and stops, not trade advice.',
         '期权带方向为近似（~软性——盘口规则，非买卖报价匹配）。每个结论均为确定性规则，无评分、无黑箱。参考价位与做市商地图仅为择时与止损背景，不构成交易建议。') }}
  </p>
</div>

<!-- data_base.js sets window.DATA_BASE → routes the live options-flow fetch to the
     public R2 data plane (present on 171 site pages; v1 omitted it, so R2 flow never loaded). -->
<script src="data_base.js"></script>
<!-- Inline JS — data loads, polling, table render -->
<script>
(function(){
'use strict';

// ── Config injected from nightly build ────────────────────────────────────
var BASE_DATA = {{ intraday_flow | tojson if intraday_flow else '{}' }};
var RVOL_CONFIRM = BASE_DATA.rvol_confirm || 1.30;
var DUR_MIN = BASE_DATA.durability_min || 0.60;
var WASHOUT_LB = BASE_DATA.washout_lookback || 10;
var leaders = BASE_DATA.leaders || [];
var LEADERS_BY_TK = {};
leaders.forEach(function(l){ LEADERS_BY_TK[l.ticker] = l; });

// ── Live state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var quoteState = {};   // ticker -> {price, changePct, vol, hi, lo}
var pulseState = {};   // ticker -> {vwap, vol_durability, higher_lows, cum_vol, bars_today, rvol_tod, session_high, session_low}
var flowState = {};    // ticker -> {ncp(~soft), flow_dur, badges[], session_tier, call_share}
var flowAsof = null, flowRTH = false;

// ── View state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var sortCol = 'rvol', sortDir = -1;
var activeBasket = 'all', activeStance = 'all', searchQ = '', groupByStance = true;
var openRows = {};     // ticker -> true when detail expanded

// ── Stance lane metadata (labels localized; keys deterministic) ────────────
var STANCE_META = {
  act:         { dot:'🟢', lane:'lane-act',    en:'Buy now',            zh:'现在买入', order:0 },
  get_ready:   { dot:'🔵', lane:'lane-ready',  en:'Almost ready',       zh:'即将就绪', order:1 },
  in_favour:   { dot:'🏃', lane:'lane-fav',    en:'In favour',          zh:'走势占优', order:2 },
  take_profits:{ dot:'🟠', lane:'lane-profit', en:'Take profits',       zh:'获利了结', order:3 },
  watch:       { dot:'👀', lane:'lane-watch',  en:"Watch — don't chase",zh:'观望——勿追', order:4 },
  stand_aside: { dot:'⚪', lane:'lane-aside',  en:'Stand aside',        zh:'暂时观望', order:5 }
};

// ── URL helpers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function snapUrl() { return window.LIVE_SNAPSHOT_URL || 'live/quotes.json'; }
function pulseUrl() { return 'live/flow_pulse.json'; }
function r2Url(path) {
  var base = (window.DATA_BASE || '').replace(/\/+$/, '');
  return base ? base + '/' + path : null;
}

// ── DST-correct ET helper ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
function _etMinutes() {
  var fmt = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-US', {timeZone:'America/New_York', hour12:false, hour:'2-digit', minute:'2-digit'});
  var parts = fmt.formatToParts(new Date()), h=0, m=0;
  parts.forEach(function(p){ if (p.type==='hour') h=parseInt(p.value,10); else if (p.type==='minute') m=parseInt(p.value,10); });
  return h*60 + m;
}
function isMarketHours() { var e=_etMinutes(); return e >= (9*60+25) && e <= (16*60+5); }

// ── Derived metrics ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function computeRvol(leader, quote, pulse) {
  if (pulse && pulse.rvol_tod != null) return pulse.rvol_tod;   // fastpath-precomputed wins
  if (!quote || !quote.vol || !leader.adv20_shares) return null;
  var curve = leader.vol_share_curve;
  if (!curve || !curve.length) return null;
  var etMins = _etMinutes(), elapsed = etMins - (9*60+30);
  if (elapsed < 0) elapsed = 0;
  var frac = Math.min(elapsed / (6.5*60), 1.0);
  var cumIdx = Math.min(Math.floor(frac * curve.length), curve.length - 1);
  var cumShare = curve[cumIdx] || 0;
  if (cumShare <= 0) return null;
  return quote.vol / (leader.adv20_shares * cumShare);
}
function computeRangePos(quote) {
  if (!quote || quote.lo == null || quote.hi == null || quote.price == null) return null;
  var rng = quote.hi - quote.lo;
  return rng > 0 ? (quote.price - quote.lo) / rng : null;
}
function computeVwapDelta(quote, pulse) {
  if (!quote || !quote.price || !pulse || !pulse.vwap) return null;
  return (quote.price - pulse.vwap) / pulse.vwap * 100;
}

// ── Confluence legs (mirror engine/intraday_flow.confluence_legs) ──────────
function computeLegs(leader, quote, pulse, flow) {
  var L1 = null;
  if (leader.bb_lower_reclaim_days != null) L1 = leader.bb_lower_reclaim_days <= WASHOUT_LB;
  else if (leader.drawdown_21d_pct != null && leader.recovery_begun != null) L1 = leader.drawdown_21d_pct <= -0.12 && leader.recovery_begun;
  if (L1 === null) {
    var proxy = false;
    if (leader.entry_signal && leader.entry_signal.status) {
      var st = (leader.entry_signal.status || '').toLowerCase();
      proxy = st.indexOf('washout')>=0 || st.indexOf('reclaim')>=0 || st.indexOf('bounce')>=0 || st.indexOf('buy')>=0;
    }
    if (!proxy && leader.vol_squeeze && leader.vol_squeeze.coiled) proxy = true;
    if (proxy) L1 = true;
  }
  var L2 = false;
  if (quote && quote.price && pulse && pulse.vwap) L2 = quote.price > pulse.vwap && quote.price > (leader.prev_close || 0);
  var rvol = computeRvol(leader, quote, pulse);
  var L3 = rvol !== null && rvol >= RVOL_CONFIRM;
  var volDur = pulse ? (pulse.vol_durability != null ? pulse.vol_durability : null) : null;
  var L4 = volDur !== null && volDur >= DUR_MIN;
  var L5 = false;
  if (flow) {
    var ncpPos = flow.ncp != null && flow.ncp > 0;
    var durOk = flow.flow_dur != null ? flow.flow_dur >= DUR_MIN : ncpPos;  // degrade to sign if dur absent
    L5 = ncpPos && durOk;
  }
  var L6 = false;
  if (leader.mtf_upturn_state) {
    var mst = (leader.mtf_upturn_state || '').toUpperCase();
    L6 = mst === 'UPTURN_WATCH' || mst === 'UPTURN_CONFIRMED';
  } else if (leader.mtf_upturn_K != null) L6 = leader.mtf_upturn_K >= 2;
  var L7 = leader.failed_breakout_trap === false ? true : null;
  var legs = [L1, L2, L3, L4, L5, L6, L7];
  return { legs: legs, K: legs.filter(function(v){ return v === true; }).length };
}

// ── Dealer context accessor ────────────────────────────────────────────────
function dealerOf(leader) {
  var oe = leader.options_entry || {};
  return oe.dealer || null;
}

// ── Stance (mirror engine/intraday_flow.stance — deterministic precedence) ─
function computeStance(leader, quote, pulse, flow, conf) {
  var legs = conf.legs;
  var L1=legs[0], L2=legs[1], L3=legs[2], L4=legs[3], L5=legs[4], L6=legs[5], L7=legs[6];
  var squeeze = !!(leader.vol_squeeze && leader.vol_squeeze.coiled);
  var d = dealerOf(leader);
  var livePresent = isMarketHours() || !!(pulse && pulse.bars_today > 0);

  if (!livePresent) {
    if (L1 === true && (L6 === true || squeeze)) return { key:'get_ready', reason_en:'Base in place — waiting for the open.', reason_zh:'底部已成——等待开盘。', muted:true };
    return { key:'stand_aside', reason_en:'Waiting for the open — live tape not flowing yet.', reason_zh:'等待开盘——实时资金带尚未流动。', muted:true };
  }

  var vwapDelta = computeVwapDelta(quote, pulse);
  var priceUp = quote && quote.changePct != null ? quote.changePct > 0 : false;
  var emDaily = d && d.expected_move_daily_pct != null ? d.expected_move_daily_pct : null;

  // derived risk helpers (dealer-derived; None-safe → false)
  var intoCeiling = !!(d && d.call_wall_hard === true && d.call_wall_dist_sigma != null && d.call_wall_dist_sigma <= 0.5);
  var extendedUp = false;
  if (vwapDelta != null && emDaily != null && emDaily > 0 && vwapDelta >= 1.5 * emDaily) extendedUp = true;
  if (intoCeiling && vwapDelta != null && vwapDelta > 0) extendedUp = true;
  var pinWatch = false;
  if (d && d.opex_days != null && d.opex_days <= 5 && d.regime === 'long') {
    var wu = d.call_wall != null && quote.price ? Math.abs((d.call_wall - quote.price)/quote.price)*100 : null;
    var wd = d.put_wall != null && quote.price ? Math.abs((d.put_wall - quote.price)/quote.price)*100 : null;
    var mu = d.magnet_up != null && quote.price ? Math.abs((d.magnet_up - quote.price)/quote.price)*100 : null;
    var md = d.magnet_down != null && quote.price ? Math.abs((d.magnet_down - quote.price)/quote.price)*100 : null;
    var near = [wu,wd,mu,md].filter(function(x){ return x != null; });
    if (near.length && Math.min.apply(null, near) <= 1.0) pinWatch = true;
  }
  var aboveVwap = vwapDelta != null ? vwapDelta > 0 : (L2 === true);

  // 1 · Take profits — an up-move stretched into resistance / pin
  if (aboveVwap && (extendedUp || pinWatch)) {
    var why = pinWatch ? 'Pinned near a big strike into expiry — expect range-bound; don\'t chase.'
                       : 'Stretched well above the average price into the dealer ceiling — expect a pullback.';
    var whyz = pinWatch ? '临近到期被钉在大行权价附近——预期区间震荡，勿追。'
                        : '大幅高于均价并冲向做市商天花板——预期回落。';
    return { key:'take_profits', reason_en:why, reason_zh:whyz, muted:false };
  }
  // 2 · Buy now — full continuation setup, not into a ceiling.
  // Quality is a negative filter: only a KNOWN trap (L7===false) blocks; unknown
  // quality (null) must not (trap flags are sparse). Mirrors engine l7 = "is not False".
  if (L1===true && L2===true && L4===true && L7!==false && (L3===true || L5===true) && !intoCeiling) {
    return { key:'act', reason_en:'Reclaimed above the average price on durable volume; structure supports continuation.', reason_zh:'放量收复均价上方；结构支持延续。', muted:false };
  }
  // 3 · Almost ready — base built, trigger not yet fired
  if (L1===true && (L6===true || squeeze) && L7!==false && L2!==true) {
    return { key:'get_ready', reason_en:'Washout base built; waiting for a reclaim above the average price on volume.', reason_zh:'洗盘底部已成；等待放量收复均价上方。', muted:false };
  }
  // 4 · In favour — trending and holding, no fresh washout
  if (L2===true && L6===true && (L3===true || L4===true) && L7!==false && L1!==true) {
    return { key:'in_favour', reason_en:'Trending and holding above the average price; ride it, no fresh entry here.', reason_zh:'趋势中并守住均价上方；持有为宜，此处非新入场点。', muted:false };
  }
  // 5 · Watch — active without structure, or trap-prone
  if ((L3===true || priceUp) && (L1!==true || L7===false)) {
    var wr = L7===false ? 'Moving, but this name has a history of faking breakouts — wait for a clean base.'
                        : 'Moving without a washout base — wait for structure before acting.';
    var wrz = L7===false ? '有异动，但该标的有假突破前科——等待干净底部。'
                         : '异动但无洗盘底部——等待结构再行动。';
    return { key:'watch', reason_en:wr, reason_zh:wrz, muted:false };
  }
  // 6 · Stand aside
  return { key:'stand_aside', reason_en:'Quiet tape, no setup right now.', reason_zh:'盘口平静，当前无布局。', muted:true };
}

// ── Format helpers ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
function fmtNum(v, dec){ return (v==null||isNaN(v)) ? '—' : Number(v).toFixed(dec!=null?dec:2); }
function fmtPct(v){ return (v==null||isNaN(v)) ? '—' : (v>=0?'+':'')+Number(v).toFixed(2)+'%'; }
function fmtDollar(v){ return (v==null||isNaN(v)) ? '—' : '$'+Number(v).toFixed(2); }
function fmtK(n){ if(n==null||isNaN(n))return '—'; n=Number(n); if(Math.abs(n)>=1e6)return (n/1e6).toFixed(1)+'M'; if(Math.abs(n)>=1e3)return (n/1e3).toFixed(1)+'K'; return n.toFixed(0); }
function esc(s){ return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;'}[c];}); }
function lz(en, zh){ return '<span class="l-en">'+en+'</span><span class="l-zh">'+(zh||en)+'</span>'; }

// ── Plain-word metric phrasing ─────────────────────────────────────────────
function volumeWords(rvol, volDur) {
  if (rvol == null) return { en:'—', zh:'—', cls:'gauge-lo', pct:0 };
  var band = rvol >= RVOL_CONFIRM ? 'gauge-hi' : (rvol >= 0.8 ? 'gauge-med' : 'gauge-lo');
  var mult = rvol.toFixed(1) + '×';
  var holdEn = volDur != null ? (volDur >= DUR_MIN ? ' · holding' : (volDur >= DUR_MIN*0.7 ? ' · fading' : ' · not holding')) : '';
  var holdZh = volDur != null ? (volDur >= DUR_MIN ? ' · 持稳' : (volDur >= DUR_MIN*0.7 ? ' · 转弱' : ' · 未持稳')) : '';
  return { en: mult + ' normal' + holdEn, zh: mult + '正常' + holdZh, cls: band, pct: Math.min(rvol/3,1)*100 };
}
function rangeWords(rp) {
  if (rp == null) return null;
  return rp > 0.65 ? lz('near day high','接近日高') : (rp < 0.35 ? lz('near day low','接近日低') : lz('mid-range','区间中部'));
}

// ── Fetch: quotes (60s) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
var quotesInflight = false;
function fetchQuotes() {
  if (quotesInflight) return; quotesInflight = true;
  fetch(snapUrl(), {cache:'no-cache'}).then(function(r){ return r.json(); }).then(function(data){
    quotesInflight = false;
    var q = data.quotes || {};
    Object.keys(q).forEach(function(tk){ quoteState[tk] = q[tk]; });
    render();
  }).catch(function(){ quotesInflight = false; });
}

// ── Fetch: flow pulse (5min) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
var pulseInflight = false;
function fetchPulse() {
